	(footprint "TLV320ADC3140_WQFN24"
		(layer "F.Cu")
		(uuid "f019b62e-e2cb-43f7-b255-5fbf10b0e3c7")
		(at 30 30)
		(descr "TLV320ADC3140, 24-pin WQFN (RTW0024 family), 4x4mm body, 0.5mm pitch, EP 2.45mm sq (datasheets/extracted/tlv320adc3140.md). TLV320ADC3140's own SBAS993B datasheet PDF lacks the RTW0024 mechanical drawing; EP size + land pattern were cross-referenced from TCA8418 (TI SCPS215G), which uses the identical RTW0024B package (4.00x4.00mm, 0.5mm pitch) - see Task 3 extraction 'RTW0024 package + land pattern' section, sourced from TCA8418 drawing 4219135/B p.50-52. RTW0024 IDENTITY CONFIRMED (this task, WebFetch): TI's own TLV320ADC3140IRTWR product page (ti.com/product/TLV320ADC3140/part-details/TLV320ADC3140IRTWR) shows package image filename 'rtw0024h.png' and links the mechanical drawing at ti.com/lit/pdf/MPQF167C, titled 'RTW 24 / WQFN - 0.8mm max height / 4x4, 0.5mm pitch' - body size and pitch match the TCA8418 RTW0024B drawing exactly. TI's generic MPQF167C drawing does not print the exact EP dimension revision letter, so the TCA8418-sourced 2.45mm +/-0.1mm EP and land/stencil dimensions remain the best available confirmed values for this package family; no discrepancy found. Land: 24x 0.60x0.24mm pads @0.5mm pitch (RTW0024B p.51). Thermal vias: 2x2 grid targeting RTW0024B's 0.97mm spacing, drilled 0.3mm/pad 0.6mm per this task's per-IC via spec (RTW0024B's own dwg calls for 4x Ø0.2mm vias at 0.97mm spacing; enlarged to 0.3mm/0.6mm for this project's standard via size, same grid layout/count). EP paste: 4x 1.08mm sq quadrant apertures, 0.64mm gap, 78% coverage (RTW0024B p.52 stencil design, matches its stated 78% target).")
		(tags "TLV320ADC3140 WQFN24 RTW0024 audio ADC")
